## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical resilience planning, cross-region deployment, and IaC-driven CI/CD integration with chaos engineering signals.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-region ECS/Fargate with per-branch preview environments
- App Mesh traffic routing for sophisticated traffic management
- Route 53 latency-based routing for optimal user experience
- AWS Fault Injection Simulator as a quality gate before production promotion
- Automatic rollback criteria tied to SLO violations
- DR runbook for regional failover procedures
- Observability-driven development with p95 latency and error rate SLOs

